    "report_label_risk": "A consumer displaying sampled_peak_total alone could misread it as peak of the currently incomplete process set. Current scan_complete=false, incomplete_process_metrics=2 and total fields null are explicit; interpret alongside these fields. Observed sums are partial and do not update complete peaks.",
